272
00:10:39,473 --> 00:10:40,599
Please? Pretty please?

273
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:41,891
"Pretty please?"

274
00:10:41,933 --> 00:10:45,061
Not very, uh, 007.

275
00:10:45,103 --> 00:10:46,521
Look, it's my wedding day, okay?

276
00:10:46,563 --> 00:10:47,939
If you were getting married

277
00:10:47,981 --> 00:10:49,483
I would never do anything
to upset you.

278
00:10:49,524 --> 00:10:51,234
When I got married,
you slept with my sister.

279
00:10:51,276 --> 00:10:54,279
That was pretty 007.

280
00:10:57,782 --> 00:10:58,992
Hey.

281
00:10:59,033 --> 00:11:00,201
Hey. Oh, good,
good, you're here.

282
00:11:00,243 --> 00:11:01,411
